1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,040
M: Mr. Sanchez is coming in to take a look around our factory to see if it's big enough to suit his demands.

2
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:10,895
If he is satisfied, there is a good chance that he will sign a deal with us today.

3
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,360
W: I really hope that will happen.

4
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:16,440
The business this deal will bring is huge.

5
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,490
Let's just keep our fingers crossed.

6
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:19,870
M: Don't worry too much.

7
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,185
I'm sure we will get it.

8
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:24,415
After all, we have everything he requested over the phone.

9
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:28,040
Anyway, let's take off a bit early to pick him up at the airport.

10
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:30,520
W: That sounds like a good idea.

11
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:35,275
We don't want to get stuck in rush hour traffic and be late for his arrival.
